  m_Name: Ending_Acceptance
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLine
  npcID: ending_acceptance
  loopIndex: 9
  lines:
  - You sit down in the corridor.
  - Your back against her door.
  - You take out your phone.
  - The screen is very bright in the dark hallway.
  - You dial.
  - It rings twice.
  - ...
  - You tell them your name.
  - You tell them the room number.
  - You tell them what you did.
  - The loop ends.
  - Not with forgiveness.
  - Just with truth.
